<view class="container index">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-cake">🎂</view>
    <view class="title">吹吹蛋糕</view>
    <view class="subtitle">不在身边，也能吹灭TA的生日蜡烛</view>
  </view>

  <view class="quick-card card">
    <view class="quick-title">把祝福装进蛋糕里</view>
    <view class="quick-desc">
      写下想对TA说的话，录一段语音，生成一个能"对着屏幕吹"的小蛋糕 —— 让TA在生日当天收到一份只属于ta的惊喜。
    </view>
    <view class="quick-actions">
      <button class="btn" bindtap="goCreate">为TA做一个 🎂</button>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="goMine">看我做过的</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{recentCakes.length > 0}}" class="recent">
    <view class="section-title">我最近送出的</view>
    <view class="recent-list">
      <view
        wx:for="{{recentCakes}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="recent-item card"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="openCake"
      >
        <view class="recent-emoji">{{item.styleEmoji}}</view>
        <view class="recent-meta">
          <view class="recent-name">给 {{item.receiverNick}}</view>
          <view class="recent-date">{{item.createdAtText}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="recent-arrow">›</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footnote hint">
    🔒 所有祝福仅保存在你本机，重装小程序会丢失。
  </view>
</view>
